    "body": "Note on this issue: the run that opened it failed on a runner fault, not on a test.\n\n- Run 45497452184, main `b13ebd440`: `Permission denied (os error 13)` on the CARGO_HOME git database under `/usr/local/cargo`, exit 101.\n- No `FAIL` row and no `STALL` row.\n- The same fault hit run 45489995977 (`d4601c6ea`) and passed when re-run.\n\nThe stop is logged on #3303. The run is re-run one time. This issue closes itself on the next green run.\n",
